OL,3,GNEWSARazor blade hidden inside dog
OL,4,Atreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers are trying to work out whether
OL,7,Fthere is a risk to other pets after a
OL,8,Frazor blade was found hidden inside a
OL,9,Fdog treat.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said it was reported
OL,12,Fthat the treat was pushed under the
OL,13,Ffence of a home in Great Cornard at
OL,14,F12:45 GMT on Friday.
OL,16,FThe dog started to eat it, but the
OL,17,Fowner managed to pull it away and
OL,18,Fremove the blade before any injury was
OL,19,Fcaused.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
